  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CF1331A",
    "sub_id": "41432",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<div>\n\t<div>\n\t<div>依課程目標、特色與策略規劃，該課程將以國際學術參訪為主要上課進行方式，修課同學必須分組完成參訪並接受以下評量方式：</div>\n\n\t<div>1. <strong>課前準備</strong><strong> (20%)</strong>：參與課前說明、行前說明、行前配合度；分組分工討論；參考文獻之閱讀與膫解。</div>\n\n\t<div>2. <strong>參訪參與</strong><strong> (60%)</strong>：參訪參與度、配合度；參訪過程中參與討論、交流、與組員、企業互動之表現。</div>\n\n\t<div>3. <strong>參訪後</strong><strong>(</strong><strong>期末</strong><strong>)</strong><strong>個案研究分組報告</strong> <strong>(20%)</strong>：個案研究書面報告內容、分組上台報告表現。</div>\n\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "評量方式\t動作\nHomework 30%\nMid-Term Project 40%\nFinal Project  40%",
    "course_pol": "0. 希望同學們能準時出席，如果無法上課時請記得請假。\n1. 國際金融保險市場研究為三學分之選修課程，需於修業期限內修畢。\n2. 企業與學術單位參訪為課程設計安排，因此於出發前就要請各位做準備；在企業與學術單位參訪時候，需要觀察、分析、疏理參訪企業的經營優勢與面對的挑戰。\nTo learn about the basic of actuary, future courses, including required and elective, and its potential career.\nWe will also invite senior students, alumni in related fields to share experience or answer potential questions.\nIt is required and encouraged that the students engage in the class dynamics in a progressive way.",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": "課程提醒\n記得要來上課喔",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>To learn about the basic of actuary, future courses, including required and elective, and its potential career.</div>\n\n<div>We will also invite senior students, alumni in related fields to share experience or answer potential questions.</div>\n\n<div>It is required and encouraged that the students engage in the class dynamics in a progressive way.</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>期望同學能全程出席本學期課程，且必須要參與所有考試以及準時繳交各項作業。</div>\n\n<div>另外同學們需要以自己的實力準備本學期的考試以及作業</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
